07:13.080 --> 07:15.040
Now, where do we look for that pullback?

07:15.460 --> 07:16.300
Here's what we do.

07:16.540 --> 07:19.320
We take our Fibonacci, we pull it from the low to the high,

07:19.320 --> 07:24.360
